Game data exclusion

The two copies of the game's fencers' bout cutscene (src/Data/Levels/kutnohorsko/
layers/ce_bergow_bout.xml and ce_field_duel.xml) and their rows of the cutscene
table (ce_bergow_bout and ce_field_duel in
src/Data/Libs/Tables/ui/cutscene__cutscene_examples.xml), in this repository and
in the .pak files of every release, are NOT part of the Software and are NOT
covered by the MIT License above.

They are taken from Kingdom Come: Deliverance II's own data, which belongs to
Warhorse Studios and PLAION. They are provided only for use with Kingdom Come:
Deliverance II, under the game's end-user license agreement and Warhorse's
modding guidelines. No other rights are granted: do not redistribute them
outside this mod, use them in other games or products, or use them
commercially.

The mod plays the game's own voice recordings, music and sound banks by name;
none of them is included.
